var e=`## Server work mods

List of mods that were created to be used for server-side, normally used in dedicated server with thousands of players.

### Cobblemon Legendary Spawn

Add news config to modify how-when a custom list of Pokémons (Normally legendaries) will spawn, this handles things like flying/water spawn, special biome/weather conditions and probably things, all inside a simple and fast config.

Check more on: [[cobblemon_legendary_spawn|Cobblemon Legendary Spawn]]

### Cobblemon Raids

Invite and create a party of 3 players to start a raid!! Only 3 lives for team, each loss cost a live, and you need to fight through 3 Pokémon and then fight the boss (Normally a legendary/special Pokémon) with special abilities, after defeated you have the change to capture it. GUIs, config and everything was used here!!.

Check more on: [[cobblemon_raids|Cobblemon Raids]]

### Odyssey Pokedrop

Adds a new custom system to add drops to the Pokemons, with a Pokémon whitelist and supporting item nbts and multiple World loader. Mod made to work with Fabric-Spigot plugins.

Check more on: [[odyssey_pokedrop|Odyssey Pokedrop]]

### Sad Ditto

This mod's purpose is to prevent the "Bottle Cap" items from the \`cobblemon utility\` mod from being used on Ditto. Made to avoid broken Dittos inside the server due to this mod.

Commission made for Dystopia Network (Minecraft server)

Check more on: [[sad_ditto|Sad Ditto]]

### Shiny Converter

Add a new GUI to change your shinies into custom items (NBT data support), config for changing GUI placement, text format and different Pokémon checks.

This mod was made for Fabric and Forge for Minecraft 1.20.1.

Check more on: [[shiny_converter|Shiny Converter]]`;export{e as default};